    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BRANT & CO Property Consultants are delighted to present 54 Holywell View, Swords to the rental market.\r\n\r\nThis bright and well-presented two-bedroom apartment offers spacious and comfortable accommodation in the ever-popular Holywell development. The property enjoys an abundance of natural light, with large windows throughout and the added benefit of a private balcony, providing a pleasant outdoor space and open outlook.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, a generous open-plan living and dining area, separate modern fitted kitchen, two double bedrooms and a bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe living/dining room is particularly bright and spacious, with access to the balcony and ample room for both comfortable seating and a dining area. The kitchen is finished with contemporary grey units, tiled splash back and marble-effect worktops and comes equipped with a range of appliances.\r\n\r\nBoth bedrooms are well proportioned and presented, with excellent natural light, while the bathroom features a modern shower enclosure and vanity unit.\r\n\r\nHolywell is an extremely convenient and well-established development, ideally located within easy reach of Swords Village, Airside Retail Park, Dublin Airport and the M1/M50 motorway network. The area is also well served by local shops, schools, amenities and public transport links to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nPROPERTY FEATURES:\r\n\r\nTwo double bedrooms\r\nOne bathroom\r\nBright and spacious living/dining area\r\nModern fitted kitchen\r\nPrivate balcony\r\nExcellent natural light throughout\r\nWell-presented accommodation\r\nConvenient parking within the development\r\nClose to Swords, Airside and Dublin Airport\r\nExcellent access to M1 and M50\r\nWell serviced by public transport\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nBrant & Co Property Consultants\r\nPSRA Licence No. 004160"
      },
      {
